  "sourceHash": "4a1e88cf5585e7b15217c27a7d237fade51d1b64880982b506e2926adf0f5869",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "メテオリーテさん……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "ジェシカさんは、一体何を見たんでしょうか……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "……知らないままでいるほうが、良いと思うわ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "戦略上関わってくるようなことではないし……気にしないでちょうだい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "おーい、ロドスの虫けらさんたち～。いつまで隠れてるつもりなのかな～？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "――！（小声）メフィスト……！　我々の痕跡に気付いたんでしょうか……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "（小声）静かに。……あれは奴の常套手段だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "……あ～あ、残念。出てくるつもりはないみたいだねえ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "そっちのお友達が入り込んできたことに、気付いてないとでも思ってるのかい？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "まあいいや。それより、見せてあげたいものがあるんだ。きっと君らも気に入ると思うよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "と、その前に一つ教えておかないとね。――僕たちのターゲットは初めから、チェルノボーグのすべてだったんだけど……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "ここに至るまで、待って待って待ち続けて……長い間耐えてきて、ようやく――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "ウルサスに……僕たち感染者を迫害した連中に、復讐する時が来たんだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "それなのに、ここにいた連中は何をしたと思う？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "答えは簡単、一目散に逃げ出したのさ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "まだ僕らが何もしていないうちに――実に素早い反応だったよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "彼らは、移動都市群の連結を解いて、ありとあらゆる手段を使い、全速力で逃げていった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "――逃げ場なんてどこにもないのにね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "滑稽だろう？　この連中は、都市の内部にレユニオンの同胞たちが潜り込み、機会をうかがっていたことに気付いてなかったんだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "だから、結局は僕たちに捕まって、相応の罰を受けることになったのさ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "でも……「相応の罰」とは言ったけれど、臆病で残忍なこの連中に相応しい罰を与えるには――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "奴らの死骸を、僕らのシンボルマークの形になるように、並べて吊るすくらいはしてやるのが当然ってものだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "そうして、感染者が受けてきた不公平な扱い、その一切を最後には打ち砕いてやるという意思表示――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "つまり、僕たちレユニオンからの宣戦布告に使ってやるのさ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "そのためにも、まずはこの「シンボル」を燃やして、恐怖の象徴として完成させてやろうじゃないか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "――さあ、奴らに火を放て！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "はっ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "アッハハハハ！　燃やせ、燃やせ！　この炎で街中を照らしてやるんだ！　ロドスの連中に、軟弱な迫害者たちの末路を見せてやれ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "（小声）――いけない！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "（アーミヤの目を素早く覆う）",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "ドクター……！？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "見てはいけない。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
          "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
          "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
          "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
          "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
          "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
          "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
          "text": "あの炎は……悪意と狂気にまみれている。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "ドクター、手をどけてください。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "私は大丈夫です。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "――これは、私がこの目で確かめなければいけないことですから。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "彼らの行いには、いずれ必ず向き合わなければなりませんし……"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "（手をどける）",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ジェシカ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "なんで……どうして……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "ジェシカ……落ち着いて。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "――でも、本当に……こんなことって……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "……そうだな。奴らの罪は重い……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "――あの焦げ臭いにおいは、もしかして……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "メフィスト",
          "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "text": "そろそろ出ておいでよ。そこにいるんだろう？　ウサギさん。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "メフィスト",
          "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "text": "会うのはチェルノボーグ以来だねえ。にしても、さっきから何人かでコソコソやってるみたいだし、作戦でもあるのかと思ってたんだけど……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "メフィスト",
          "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "text": "まさか、黙って見てるだけなんて……期待外れも良いところだよ。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "メフィスト",
          "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "text": "見たところ、仲間をたくさん連れてきたんだろう？　それなのに、何もしないつもりなのかい？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "――これは、すべてあなたの仕業なんですか？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "メフィスト",
          "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "text": "当然じゃないか。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "メフィスト",
          "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "text": "こうして恐怖を与えるのは、最終的な損害を抑えるためには効果的な手段だからね。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "メフィスト",
          "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "text": "人が十人いたとしたら、そのうち一人を殺してやれば――"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "メフィスト",
          "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "text": "残りの九人はそれに怯えて、抵抗しなくなるだろう？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "メフィスト",
          "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "text": "だから、これこそが犠牲者を減らす一番の方法なのさ。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#9",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "――――――"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "――ドクター。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "私はもう、あの頃とは違います。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "あなたは覚えていないかもしれませんが――"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "あの頃の私は臆病で、弱くて、意気地無しで……ただ、ドクターを頼りに、前へと進んでいました。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "確かに、今もそう変わらないように見えるだろうとは思います。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "ですが、私はこれまでに十分すぎるほど惨劇を目にしてきました。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "……もちろん、できることなら二度と見たくはありません。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "それでも、私は……目を逸らさずに向き合わなければ！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "こうして言葉にすることで、自分自身に言い聞かせているんです。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "一歩も引けない、引くわけにはいかない――"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "これからも戦い続けなければ、と！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
